Boot splash tools. Install the Python packages first:

```
pip install -r script/requirement.txt
```

make_bootsplash.py: a static splash with a title and subtitle (used for splash/logo_kernel_cm3588+.bmp)
```
python3 make_bootsplash.py \
  --svg logo.svg \
  --title "CM3588+" \
  --subtitle "ByEhsan.com" \
  --color "#B8C7D9" \
  --out-bmp logo_kernel.bmp \
  --out-png bootsplash_preview.png

```

k36_intro.py: the K36 (ArkOS) boot intro and boot logos, written to splash/k36/ (see splash/k36/README.md)
```
python3 script/k36_intro.py [--out DIR]
```

fonts/: Space Grotesk (variable, SIL Open Font License), the lockup typeface, used for ".com"
